<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian forces have intensified attacks along the Venezuela border after a Venezuelan airstrike struck an ELN guerrilla camp, killing combatants and civilians. The government passed a law stripping rebels of political status and treating them as ordinary criminals, while also tightening surrender terms for armed groups, ending the “total peace” approach. The United Nations renewed its mission in Colombia and the United States reportedly participated in a bombing operation against the ELN in Venezuela. The war crimes tribunal JEP announced steep measures after a $53 million budget cut. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQUTA3MU5RT3RIaUg0b2lvWXpQbm41MDhCLVZKWDlscmJWRzBKdTktVFBzNjBDcEZROG9mZ0pmLWVEZWJ2NEZZb1N4alpOYkZDOURiS25KbUwzdUhob202NE05ajhjb1hYWHdTZlBLUTRkb2lGZERqdHllTTJjZEk5c3I5TDRuRWhRSEliMXdBNm5sNVhZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE9CRS1SUHZPbjk4c3dTWmZKVFBsQ2lnNG9uY19Hb05xajN5bjcyMEVVaFFiS3RPenJJVURrV1lEZGZIaWpVYkZCQVUtczJ0b1V5ZFBOOUFrQlNYaWplQk4yelJ2bTVvWTRu?oc=5&quot;&gt;World Socialist Web Site&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOOF9tUTNTb2k2c3pFWTM1Y